 change the psionics block, so the block stores the larger maximum (5) and all three categories and the restriction line states the roll and the split. The female +2D6 I.S.P. is the provider variant''s pool bonus. || PROVIDER SKILLS: all at the catalog base plus the printed bonus; Speak Aboriginal is Language: Aboriginal, Speak English is Language: Australian English, Basic Math is Mathematics: Basic, Identify Plants & Fruits is Identify Plants & Fruit. || NOT STORED: size 3 feet plus 3D6 inches, weight 220 + 6D6 pounds, life span 60 + 2D6 years, habitat, value, enemies and allies are in GM Notes. The block prints no equipment and no money."
